Krita Nova 32 - the Nova Krita app icon

The user's icon (a black "NK" mark on a light-to-mid grey gradient circle,
1024x1024) replaces Krita's icon:

Android (packaging/android/apk/res), for both ic_launcher (release) and
ic_launcher_next (debug / next flavors, the one our builds use):
- adaptive icon (Android 8+): background = the grey gradient, full bleed;
  foreground = the NK mark sized so the circle of the original fills the
  visible 72 dp of the 108 dp icon (the mark stays inside the 66 dp safe
  zone). The mark is also the themed (monochrome) icon. PNG layers in
  drawable-mdpi..xxxhdpi replace the vector drawables.
- legacy and round icons (mipmap-*/ic_launcher*.webp): the round icon itself.

Windows / desktop (krita/pics/branding/Next, the branding of our builds):
*-apps-krita.png 16..1024, krita.ico (.exe and taskbar icon) and
sc-apps-krita.svgz (window icon, About dialog).
